[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 8.12,
    "timecode": "00:00 - 00:08",
    "text": "In July 2022, BMW started charging rent on heated seats, not at a shop, not at a dealership,"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": 8.12,
    "end": 10.24,
    "timecode": "00:08 - 00:10",
    "text": "through the car's own screen."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": 10.24,
    "end": 17.44,
    "timecode": "00:10 - 00:17",
    "text": "South Korea, the United Kingdom, Germany, South Africa, about 15 pounds a month or 150"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": 17.44,
    "end": 18.44,
    "timecode": "00:17 - 00:18",
    "text": "a year."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": 18.44,
    "end": 20.84,
    "timecode": "00:18 - 00:20",
    "text": "Here is what made people furious."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": 20.84,
    "end": 27.08,
    "timecode": "00:20 - 00:27",
    "text": "The heating wires were already inside the seat, copper, relays, switches, bolted in at"
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": 27.08,
    "end": 28.24,
    "timecode": "00:27 - 00:28",
    "text": "the factory."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": 28.24,
    "end": 32.88,
    "timecode": "00:28 - 00:32",
    "text": "You had paid for every gram of it, but a software flag said, not unless your car"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": 32.88,
    "end": 37.08,
    "timecode": "00:32 - 00:37",
    "text": "keeps billing, BMW did not forget to install a feature."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": 37.08,
    "end": 40.36,
    "timecode": "00:37 - 00:40",
    "text": "They installed a hostage in your own front seat."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": 40.36,
    "end": 43.12,
    "timecode": "00:40 - 00:43",
    "text": "Now, if you are rolling your eyes, fair."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": 43.12,
    "end": 44.56,
    "timecode": "00:43 - 00:44",
    "text": "It is a seat warmer."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": 44.56,
    "end": 45.56,
    "timecode": "00:44 - 00:45",
    "text": "Who cares?"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": 45.56,
    "end": 47.64,
    "timecode": "00:45 - 00:47",
    "text": "Except this was not a prank."
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": 47.64,
    "end": 51.0,
    "timecode": "00:47 - 00:51",
    "text": "It was a test, and somebody was taking notes."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": 51.0,
    "end": 56.28,
    "timecode": "00:51 - 00:56",
    "text": "Because one company had already tried this for years, and it did not start with a car."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": 56.28,
    "end": 57.68,
    "timecode": "00:56 - 00:57",
    "text": "Meet HP."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": 57.68,
    "end": 61.72,
    "timecode": "00:57 - 01:01",
    "text": "In 2016, HP pushed a quiet update to its printers."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": 61.72,
    "end": 64.12,
    "timecode": "01:01 - 01:04",
    "text": "It was called Dynamic Security."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": 64.12,
    "end": 66.08,
    "timecode": "01:04 - 01:06",
    "text": "Owners woke up to a dead machine."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": 66.08,
    "end": 67.8,
    "timecode": "01:06 - 01:07",
    "text": "The ink cartridge was full."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": 67.8,
    "end": 70.08,
    "timecode": "01:07 - 01:10",
    "text": "It just was not made by HP."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": 70.08,
    "end": 73.0,
    "timecode": "01:10 - 01:13",
    "text": "No warning, no vote, just an update."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": 73.0,
    "end": 74.0,
    "timecode": "01:13 - 01:14",
    "text": "Overnight."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": 74.0,
    "end": 75.64,
    "timecode": "01:14 - 01:15",
    "text": "You did not buy a printer."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": 75.64,
    "end": 78.2,
    "timecode": "01:15 - 01:18",
    "text": "You bought a printer that audits your ink."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": 78.2,
    "end": 82.36,
    "timecode": "01:18 - 01:22",
    "text": "Italy's competition regulator find HP 10 million euros."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": 82.36,
    "end": 83.92,
    "timecode": "01:22 - 01:23",
    "text": "That was 2020."
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": 83.92,
    "end": 88.24,
    "timecode": "01:23 - 01:28",
    "text": "Hetergroups in Belgium, Spain, Italy, and Portugal got a settlement."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": 88.24,
    "end": 89.44,
    "timecode": "01:28 - 01:29",
    "text": "HP paid."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": 89.44,
    "end": 91.24,
    "timecode": "01:29 - 01:31",
    "text": "The business model stayed."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": 91.24,
    "end": 96.16,
    "timecode": "01:31 - 01:36",
    "text": "In 2024, HP's own CEO said the quiet part out loud."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "start": 96.16,
    "end": 100.72,
    "timecode": "01:36 - 01:40",
    "text": "Every time a customer buys a printer, he said, it is an investment for HP."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "start": 100.72,
    "end": 106.44,
    "timecode": "01:40 - 01:46",
    "text": "If that customer does not print enough, or does not use HP supplies, it is a bad investment."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "start": 106.44,
    "end": 107.84,
    "timecode": "01:46 - 01:47",
    "text": "Read that slowly."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "start": 107.84,
    "end": 109.56,
    "timecode": "01:47 - 01:49",
    "text": "You paid HP."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "start": 109.56,
    "end": 112.68,
    "timecode": "01:49 - 01:52",
    "text": "And somehow, you became HP's investment."
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "start": 112.68,
    "end": 116.12,
    "timecode": "01:52 - 01:56",
    "text": "And the moment you buy cheaper ink, you become a bad one."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "start": 116.12,
    "end": 118.16,
    "timecode": "01:56 - 01:58",
    "text": "A cold seat is an insult."
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "start": 118.16,
    "end": 120.4,
    "timecode": "01:58 - 02:00",
    "text": "A dead printer is an afternoon."
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "start": 120.4,
    "end": 124.4,
    "timecode": "02:00 - 02:04",
    "text": "But what happens when the locked machine is the one that feeds a family?"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "start": 124.4,
    "end": 128.16,
    "timecode": "02:04 - 02:08",
    "text": "A hog farmer in Nebraska stood in front of his state lawmakers."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "start": 128.16,
    "end": 129.32,
    "timecode": "02:08 - 02:09",
    "text": "2017."
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "start": 129.32,
    "end": 131.12,
    "timecode": "02:09 - 02:11",
    "text": "His equipment had broken down."
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "start": 131.12,
    "end": 134.36,
    "timecode": "02:11 - 02:14",
    "text": "He told them there is no time to wait for a dealer."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "start": 134.36,
    "end": 136.52,
    "timecode": "02:14 - 02:16",
    "text": "Farmers can often swap apart themselves."
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "start": 136.52,
    "end": 140.52,
    "timecode": "02:16 - 02:20",
    "text": "But the machine would not accept the new part until a dealer plugged in a laptop and"
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "start": 140.52,
    "end": 141.52,
    "timecode": "02:20 - 02:21",
    "text": "approved it."
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "start": 141.52,
    "end": 142.52,
    "timecode": "02:21 - 02:22",
    "text": "The price?"
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "start": 142.52,
    "end": 144.76,
    "timecode": "02:22 - 02:24",
    "text": "$230 to show up."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "start": 144.76,
    "end": 148.52,
    "timecode": "02:24 - 02:28",
    "text": "Plus $130 an hour to plug in one cable."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "start": 148.52,
    "end": 149.92,
    "timecode": "02:28 - 02:29",
    "text": "Whose tractor was it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "start": 149.92,
    "end": 152.8,
    "timecode": "02:29 - 02:32",
    "text": "So farmers did what cornered people always do."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "start": 152.8,
    "end": 154.6,
    "timecode": "02:32 - 02:34",
    "text": "They went looking for outlaws."
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "start": 154.6,
    "end": 158.92,
    "timecode": "02:34 - 02:38",
    "text": "Hackers in Eastern Europe were already selling cracked tractor software."
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "start": 158.92,
    "end": 160.24,
    "timecode": "02:38 - 02:40",
    "text": "Forums in Ukraine."
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "start": 160.24,
    "end": 161.36,
    "timecode": "02:40 - 02:41",
    "text": "Pirate firmware."
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "start": 161.36,
    "end": 163.0,
    "timecode": "02:41 - 02:43",
    "text": "And the tractor wakes up."
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "start": 163.0,
    "end": 165.08,
    "timecode": "02:43 - 02:45",
    "text": "Think about how backwards that is."
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "start": 165.08,
    "end": 169.96,
    "timecode": "02:45 - 02:49",
    "text": "An American farmer downloads cracked code so he can fix his own machine."
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "start": 169.96,
    "end": 172.52,
    "timecode": "02:49 - 02:52",
    "text": "Because the legal route is a dealer's laptop."
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "start": 172.52,
    "end": 177.6,
    "timecode": "02:52 - 02:57",
    "text": "John Deere's license agreement forbids nearly all repair backed by copyright law."
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "start": 177.6,
    "end": 181.56,
    "timecode": "02:57 - 03:01",
    "text": "The pirate respects the farmer's ownership more than the company does."
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "start": 181.56,
    "end": 183.72,
    "timecode": "03:01 - 03:03",
    "text": "So who signed off on all this?"
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "start": 183.72,
    "end": 185.08,
    "timecode": "03:03 - 03:05",
    "text": "Not a villain in a cape."
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "start": 185.08,
    "end": 186.56,
    "timecode": "03:05 - 03:06",
    "text": "A spreadsheet."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "start": 186.56,
    "end": 189.76,
    "timecode": "03:06 - 03:09",
    "text": "Wall Street prices every company with a multiplier."
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "start": 189.76,
    "end": 192.6,
    "timecode": "03:09 - 03:12",
    "text": "The tractor once and investors get nervous."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "start": 192.6,
    "end": 194.08,
    "timecode": "03:12 - 03:14",
    "text": "What if a recession hits?"
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "start": 194.08,
    "end": 195.88,
    "timecode": "03:14 - 03:15",
    "text": "What if nobody buys next year?"
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "start": 195.88,
    "end": 200.28,
    "timecode": "03:15 - 03:20",
    "text": "So that company is worth maybe one or two times its yearly sales."
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "start": 200.28,
    "end": 201.6,
    "timecode": "03:20 - 03:21",
    "text": "Now watch the trick."
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "start": 201.6,
    "end": 202.8,
    "timecode": "03:21 - 03:22",
    "text": "Same tractor."
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "start": 202.8,
    "end": 204.04,
    "timecode": "03:22 - 03:24",
    "text": "Same factory."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "start": 204.04,
    "end": 205.24,
    "timecode": "03:24 - 03:25",
    "text": "Same farmer."
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "start": 205.24,
    "end": 208.12,
    "timecode": "03:25 - 03:28",
    "text": "But now a monthly bill unlocks it."
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "start": 208.12,
    "end": 210.6,
    "timecode": "03:28 - 03:30",
    "text": "The accountants give the revenue a new name."
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "start": 210.6,
    "end": 211.6,
    "timecode": "03:30 - 03:31",
    "text": "Recurring."
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "start": 211.6,
    "end": 214.84,
    "timecode": "03:31 - 03:34",
    "text": "And investors start pricing it like software."
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "start": 214.84,
    "end": 219.04,
    "timecode": "03:34 - 03:39",
    "text": "Software gets six, seven, sometimes far more times revenue."
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "start": 219.04,
    "end": 220.52,
    "timecode": "03:39 - 03:40",
    "text": "Not for a better tractor."
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "start": 220.52,
    "end": 223.04,
    "timecode": "03:40 - 03:43",
    "text": "For a customer who cannot leave."
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "start": 223.04,
    "end": 225.8,
    "timecode": "03:43 - 03:45",
    "text": "Take a company with one billion in sales."
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "start": 225.8,
    "end": 228.12,
    "timecode": "03:45 - 03:48",
    "text": "Worth about one and a half billion."
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "start": 228.12,
    "end": 230.6,
    "timecode": "03:48 - 03:50",
    "text": "Convince investors it is a subscription business."
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "start": 230.6,
    "end": 232.36,
    "timecode": "03:50 - 03:52",
    "text": "At six and a half times."
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "start": 232.36,
    "end": 234.56,
    "timecode": "03:52 - 03:54",
    "text": "And it is worth nearly seven."
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "start": 234.56,
    "end": 235.56,
    "timecode": "03:54 - 03:55",
    "text": "Overnight."
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "start": 235.56,
    "end": 236.56,
    "timecode": "03:55 - 03:56",
    "text": "No new invention."
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "start": 236.56,
    "end": 237.92,
    "timecode": "03:56 - 03:57",
    "text": "No new feature."
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "start": 237.92,
    "end": 238.92,
    "timecode": "03:57 - 03:58",
    "text": "Just a paywall."
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "start": 238.92,
    "end": 240.88,
    "timecode": "03:58 - 04:00",
    "text": "On something you already own."
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "start": 240.88,
    "end": 242.68,
    "timecode": "04:00 - 04:02",
    "text": "And the CEO's stock options?"
  },
  {
    "id": 94,
    "start": 242.68,
    "end": 244.4,
    "timecode": "04:02 - 04:04",
    "text": "Their value jumps."
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "start": 244.4,
    "end": 246.28,
    "timecode": "04:04 - 04:06",
    "text": "That is not simple greed."
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "start": 246.28,
    "end": 248.12,
    "timecode": "04:06 - 04:08",
    "text": "Greed would be easier to fight."
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "start": 248.12,
    "end": 252.52,
    "timecode": "04:08 - 04:12",
    "text": "It is a scoreboard that pays executives to take your ownership away."
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "start": 252.52,
    "end": 255.24,
    "timecode": "04:12 - 04:15",
    "text": "Because the idea is a hundred years old."
  },
  {
    "id": 99,
    "start": 255.24,
    "end": 256.24,
    "timecode": "04:15 - 04:16",
    "text": "Winter."
  },
  {
    "id": 100,
    "start": 256.24,
    "end": 257.24,
    "timecode": "04:16 - 04:17",
    "text": "1924."
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "start": 257.24,
    "end": 258.24,
    "timecode": "04:17 - 04:18",
    "text": "Geneva."
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "start": 258.24,
    "end": 261.6,
    "timecode": "04:18 - 04:21",
    "text": "A room full of men who sold the world its light."
  },
  {
    "id": 103,
    "start": 261.6,
    "end": 263.0,
    "timecode": "04:21 - 04:23",
    "text": "Osrom from Germany."
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "start": 263.0,
    "end": 264.56,
    "timecode": "04:23 - 04:24",
    "text": "Phillips from Holland."
  },
  {
    "id": 105,
    "start": 264.56,
    "end": 266.48,
    "timecode": "04:24 - 04:26",
    "text": "General Electric from America."
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "start": 266.48,
    "end": 267.88,
    "timecode": "04:26 - 04:27",
    "text": "Rivals on paper."
  },
  {
    "id": 107,
    "start": 267.88,
    "end": 269.32,
    "timecode": "04:27 - 04:29",
    "text": "Partners in secret."
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "start": 269.32,
    "end": 270.88,
    "timecode": "04:29 - 04:30",
    "text": "They had one problem."
  },
  {
    "id": 109,
    "start": 270.88,
    "end": 273.2,
    "timecode": "04:30 - 04:33",
    "text": "Their light bulbs were too good."
  },
  {
    "id": 110,
    "start": 273.2,
    "end": 275.8,
    "timecode": "04:33 - 04:35",
    "text": "Some burned 2,500 hours."
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "start": 275.8,
    "end": 281.76,
    "timecode": "04:35 - 04:41",
    "text": "There is one in a California fire station that has glowed almost non-stop since 1901."
  },
  {
    "id": 112,
    "start": 281.76,
    "end": 282.76,
    "timecode": "04:41 - 04:42",
    "text": "Great product."
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "start": 282.76,
    "end": 284.4,
    "timecode": "04:42 - 04:44",
    "text": "Terrible business."
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "start": 284.4,
    "end": 287.2,
    "timecode": "04:44 - 04:47",
    "text": "Nobody comes back to buy a bulb that never dies."
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "start": 287.2,
    "end": 288.6,
    "timecode": "04:47 - 04:48",
    "text": "So they signed a pact."
  },
  {
    "id": 116,
    "start": 288.6,
    "end": 290.6,
    "timecode": "04:48 - 04:50",
    "text": "They called it Phoebus."
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "start": 290.6,
    "end": 294.2,
    "timecode": "04:50 - 04:54",
    "text": "Every bulb would be built to die after 1,000 hours."
  },
  {
    "id": 118,
    "start": 294.2,
    "end": 295.72,
    "timecode": "04:54 - 04:55",
    "text": "They tested the bulbs."
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "start": 295.72,
    "end": 298.92,
    "timecode": "04:55 - 04:58",
    "text": "Make a bulb that lasts too long and you were fined."
  },
  {
    "id": 120,
    "start": 298.92,
    "end": 300.8,
    "timecode": "04:58 - 05:00",
    "text": "Find for making a better product."
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "start": 300.8,
    "end": 304.56,
    "timecode": "05:00 - 05:04",
    "text": "A hundred years later, nobody needs a secret meeting in Geneva."
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "start": 304.56,
    "end": 305.68,
    "timecode": "05:04 - 05:05",
    "text": "No week filament."
  },
  {
    "id": 123,
    "start": 305.68,
    "end": 307.04,
    "timecode": "05:05 - 05:07",
    "text": "No cracked plastic."
  },
  {
    "id": 124,
    "start": 307.04,
    "end": 308.32,
    "timecode": "05:07 - 05:08",
    "text": "No evidence."
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "start": 308.32,
    "end": 312.52,
    "timecode": "05:08 - 05:12",
    "text": "Just one line of code and a server that says access revoked."
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "start": 312.52,
    "end": 313.52,
    "timecode": "05:12 - 05:13",
    "text": "Same incentive."
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "start": 313.52,
    "end": 314.8,
    "timecode": "05:13 - 05:14",
    "text": "Better paperwork."
  },
  {
    "id": 128,
    "start": 314.8,
    "end": 319.68,
    "timecode": "05:14 - 05:19",
    "text": "And if you think this only hurts people with BMWs, go to a small town in India."
  },
  {
    "id": 129,
    "start": 319.68,
    "end": 323.8,
    "timecode": "05:19 - 05:23",
    "text": "Take a delivery rider buying a smartphone on easy monthly payments."
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "start": 323.8,
    "end": 326.08,
    "timecode": "05:23 - 05:26",
    "text": "Phone sold this way can carry a lock."
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "start": 326.08,
    "end": 327.76,
    "timecode": "05:26 - 05:27",
    "text": "The lender controls it."
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "start": 327.76,
    "end": 329.48,
    "timecode": "05:27 - 05:29",
    "text": "He is late on one payment."
  },
  {
    "id": 133,
    "start": 329.48,
    "end": 330.48,
    "timecode": "05:29 - 05:30",
    "text": "A day."
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "start": 330.48,
    "end": 331.48,
    "timecode": "05:30 - 05:31",
    "text": "Maybe two."
  },
  {
    "id": 135,
    "start": 331.48,
    "end": 333.04,
    "timecode": "05:31 - 05:33",
    "text": "The screen goes dark."
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "start": 333.04,
    "end": 337.2,
    "timecode": "05:33 - 05:37",
    "text": "His map, his orders, his income behind a padlock."
  },
  {
    "id": 137,
    "start": 337.2,
    "end": 339.48,
    "timecode": "05:37 - 05:39",
    "text": "The loan app is not asking for the money."
  },
  {
    "id": 138,
    "start": 339.48,
    "end": 343.08,
    "timecode": "05:39 - 05:43",
    "text": "It is holding his job hostage until the money arrives."
  },
  {
    "id": 139,
    "start": 343.08,
    "end": 346.08,
    "timecode": "05:43 - 05:46",
    "text": "In America, regulators saw the same pattern."
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "start": 346.08,
    "end": 349.32,
    "timecode": "05:46 - 05:49",
    "text": "In June 2024, the government sued Adobe."
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "start": 349.32,
    "end": 352.24,
    "timecode": "05:49 - 05:52",
    "text": "It said customers were stuck in annual plans."
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "start": 352.24,
    "end": 354.8,
    "timecode": "05:52 - 05:54",
    "text": "Cancel early and pay half of what is left."
  },
  {
    "id": 143,
    "start": 354.8,
    "end": 356.6,
    "timecode": "05:54 - 05:56",
    "text": "So what happened to the seat?"
  },
  {
    "id": 144,
    "start": 356.6,
    "end": 360.4,
    "timecode": "05:56 - 06:00",
    "text": "In September 2023, BMW quietly dropped it."
  },
  {
    "id": 145,
    "start": 360.4,
    "end": 361.6,
    "timecode": "06:00 - 06:01",
    "text": "No new conscience."
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "start": 361.6,
    "end": 364.48,
    "timecode": "06:01 - 06:04",
    "text": "Enough owners said no, loudly."
  },
  {
    "id": 147,
    "start": 364.48,
    "end": 365.8,
    "timecode": "06:04 - 06:05",
    "text": "Farmers got a law too."
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "start": 365.8,
    "end": 367.92,
    "timecode": "06:05 - 06:07",
    "text": "Colorado, 2023."
  },
  {
    "id": 149,
    "start": 367.92,
    "end": 370.72,
    "timecode": "06:07 - 06:10",
    "text": "The first date to write one for tractors."
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "start": 370.72,
    "end": 374.72,
    "timecode": "06:10 - 06:14",
    "text": "Minnesota and California passed their own for phones and laptops."
  },
  {
    "id": 151,
    "start": 374.72,
    "end": 377.92,
    "timecode": "06:14 - 06:17",
    "text": "It is the first time a few of them blinked."
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "start": 377.92,
    "end": 380.12,
    "timecode": "06:17 - 06:20",
    "text": "But look at what they were willing to try."
  },
  {
    "id": 153,
    "start": 380.12,
    "end": 381.12,
    "timecode": "06:20 - 06:21",
    "text": "A seat."
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "start": 381.12,
    "end": 382.12,
    "timecode": "06:21 - 06:22",
    "text": "A printer."
  },
  {
    "id": 155,
    "start": 382.12,
    "end": 383.12,
    "timecode": "06:22 - 06:23",
    "text": "A tractor."
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "start": 383.12,
    "end": 384.12,
    "timecode": "06:23 - 06:24",
    "text": "A phone."
  },
  {
    "id": 157,
    "start": 384.12,
    "end": 388.44,
    "timecode": "06:24 - 06:28",
    "text": "Whatever you own is one software update from becoming a lease."
  },
  {
    "id": 158,
    "start": 388.44,
    "end": 390.16,
    "timecode": "06:28 - 06:30",
    "text": "The seat is warm again."
  },
  {
    "id": 159,
    "start": 390.16,
    "end": 392.08,
    "timecode": "06:30 - 06:32",
    "text": "The question was never the heat."
  },
  {
    "id": 160,
    "start": 392.08,
    "end": 394.08,
    "timecode": "06:32 - 06:34",
    "text": "It was who's seat it is."
  },
  {
    "id": 161,
    "start": 394.08,
    "end": 399.52,
    "timecode": "06:34 - 06:39",
    "text": "Next time a screen asks for rent on something you own, remember who is holding the key."
  },
  {
    "id": 162,
    "start": 399.52,
    "end": 400.12,
    "timecode": "06:39 - 06:40",
    "text": "See you next time."
  }
]